{
  "id": "g-dd-inventory-low-code",
  "name": "Inventory & Stock Health (low-code)",
  "description": "The money in stock, the SKUs below their reorder level and the value stuck in stock that has not sold in 90 days; how full each warehouse is; the slow movers worth most; and the reorder list itself, with a suggested order quantity per SKU.",
  "connection_id": "rbt-sample-northwind-duckdb-4f2",
  "exported_report_code": "g-dd-inventory-low-code",
  "state": {
    "widgets": [
      {
        "id": "w-dd19-text-title",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPosition": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1
        },
        "dataSource": null,
        "displayConfig": {
          "textContent": "## Inventory & Stock Health\n\n14 SKUs are below their reorder level, 4 of them in Rotterdam, and Rotterdam is the warehouse with no room left: 94% of capacity against 71% in Frankfurt and 52% in Sao Paulo. 62,110.83 sits in 9 slow movers that have not sold in 90 days, none of them worth more than 6,979.31 on its own, and every one of them is in a different building - so the money to free is spread thin while the space problem is in one place.\n\nThe money in stock, the size of today's ordering job and the money stuck, then where there is room and what to clear, then the list to act on. **Below reorder level only** is ticked, so the table is today's reorder list; untick it to see all 1,000 stock rows. It moves the table alone - the three numbers keep their own meaning. Space used counts everything in a building, so it does not narrow with **Category**."
        },
        "columns": null,
        "shape": null
      },
      {
        "id": "w-dd19-kpi-stock-value",
        "type": "number",
        "gridPosition": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 2
        },
        "dataSource": {
          "mode": "visual",
          "visualQuery": {
            "kind": "cube",
            "cubeId": "dd-inventory",
            "table": "",
            "filters": [],
            "summarize": [],
            "groupBy": [],
            "sort": [],
            "limit": 500,
            "cubeSelection": {
              "dimensions": [],
              "measures": [
                "StockValue"
              ],
              "segments": [],
              "filters": [],
              "granularities": {},
              "order": [],
              "limit": null,
              "paramBindings": [
                {
                  "param": "warehouse",
                  "member": "Warehouse",
                  "operator": "equals"
                },
                {
                  "param": "category",
                  "member": "Category",
                  "operator": "in"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "generatedSql": "SELECT\n  CAST(SUM(stock.qty_on_hand * stock.unit_cost) AS DECIMAL(31,4)) AS \"StockValue\"\nFROM (SELECT l.*, p.unit_cost\n  FROM dash_demo.stock_levels l\n  LEFT JOIN dash_demo.products p ON p.product_id = l.product_id) stock\nLEFT JOIN dash_demo.products ON stock.product_id = dash_demo.products.product_id\nLEFT JOIN dash_demo.warehouses ON stock.warehouse_id = dash_demo.warehouses.warehouse_id\nWHERE dash_demo.warehouses.name = ${warehouse}\n  AND dash_demo.products.category IN (${category})"
        },
        "displayConfig": {
          "columnSettings": {
            "StockValue": {
              "numberStyle": "currency",
              "currency": "EUR"
            }
          },
          "numberField": "StockValue",
          "_auto_numberField": true,
          "numberFormat": "currency",
          "_auto_numberFormat": true,
          "userPicked": true,
          "numberLabel": "Stock value"
        },
        "columns": [
          {
            "columnName": "StockValue",
            "typeName": "DOUBLE",
            "isNullable": true
          }
        ],
        "shape": {
          "dims": [],
